    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><strong>About WPP Media</strong></p> <p>WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. </p> <p>WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.</p> <p>For more information, visit <a href=\"wppmedia.com\">wppmedia.com</a>.</p></div><p></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">3518- Global Client Strategy Director</span></strong></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW47424442 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW47424442 BCX8\">Role Summary and Impact</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW47424442 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">About WPP Media Solutions:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">WPP Media Solutions is a leading global media and technology company at the forefront of digital advertising innovation. We empower brands to connect with audiences effectively through&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">cutting-edge</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;programmatic solutions, data-driven insights, and unparalleled&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">expertise</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">. Our Global Client Strategy team is pivotal in fostering deep, strategic partnerships with our most valuable global clients and their agency networks, driving mutual growth and operational excellence across markets.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Role Overview:&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">The Global Client Strategy Director is a critical leadership role within WPP Media Solutions, responsible for spearheading the strategic partnership with our global clients and their agency networks. This individual will act as the primary strategic liaison, driving the adoption and effective </span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">utilization</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;of WPP Media Solutions' offerings across various markets. You will be instrumental in translating client business&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">objectives</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;into&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">addressable media</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;strategies, ensuring global operational consistency, and fostering a culture of innovation and collaboration. This role requires a strategic thinker with exceptional client management skills, a deep understanding of programmatic advertising, and a proven ability to drive growth in a global context.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Key Responsibilities:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Agency &amp; Market Management:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Serve as a dedicated and trusted point of contact for key agency partners, Global client leads, and the Global Investment community.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Proactively manage and coordinate efforts across markets, collaborating closely with both regional and local WPP Media Solutions market colleagues to ensure seamless execution and consistent strategy.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Develop a&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">thorough</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;understanding of clients' overarching business&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">objectives</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">identify</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;key decision-makers, and work in close partnership with agencies to proactively overcome any blockers to the full&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">utilization</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;of the WPP Media Solutions suite.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Act as a strategic programmatic advisor for both WPP Media Solutions' internal teams and local agency partners, championing global operational excellence, consistency, and best practices.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"4\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Be responsible for</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;assembling and orchestrating multidisciplinary experts from across the WPP Media Solutions organization, fostering a cohesive team approach to address and deliver on complex client challenges.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Reporting &amp; Performance Monitoring:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">T</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">rack and report on global investment performance, closely&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">monitor</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;key metrics, and prepare comprehensive aggregated reports that&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">provide</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;actionable insights to clients and internal stakeholders.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"5\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Actively contribute to various agency&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Pacing meetings and Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs), presenting strategic updates, performance insights, and future recommendations.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Education &amp; Innovation:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Strategically manage and evolve the agency Education Program, aligning WPP Media Solutions' innovations with agency needs to drive continuous learning, capability enhancement, and the adoption of&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">cutting-edge</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;solutions.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Skills and Experience:</span></span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Experience working in client-facing, strategic, and/or business-development role(s) within the media, advertising, or technology sectors. </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Proven&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">track record</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;in business development with demonstrable success in driving client growth, revenue monitoring, and expansion of strategic partnerships.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">E</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">xperience working across multiple international markets is&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">beneficial,&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">showcasing</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;an understanding of diverse market dynamics and cultural nuances.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">U</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">nderstanding of agency and client stakeholder management, including experience navigating complex organizational structures and influencing key decision-makers.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Strong interpersonal and communication skills, with a proven ability to collaborate effectively wit</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">h wider internal teams and build robust, lasting relationships with external partners.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Creative approach to problem-solving, coupled with the ability to&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">maintain</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;a strategic \"big picture\" view while also&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">demonstrating</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;meticulous attention to detail.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Demonstrated ability to lead and motivate cross-functional teams without direct reporting lines.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"6\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">Experience</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"Normal (Web)\">&nbsp;in programmatic advertising, ad-tech, and the broader digital media landscape is essential.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Life at WPP Media &amp; Benefits</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Championing Growth and Development</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">We</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">Create an Open environment</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we're together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That's why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335559739&quot;:0}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location</span></em><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Please read our Privacy Notice (</span><a href=\"https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy</span></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">)</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.</span><span data-contrast=\"none\"> </span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">#LI-Promoted</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p></p> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\">Please read our <a href=\"https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment\">Privacy Notice</a></span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;<span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8\">for more information on how we process the information you provide.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
