    schema:description "Velkommen om bord – Welcome aboard! What can you expect? A team with Norwegian roots - highly motivated and international - manufacturer of the best omega-3 products - a crew with a lot of omega-3 expertise – this and much more, that’s NORSAN. Our mission? We want to inform and educate about omega-3 fatty acids and their positive effects on the body. At the same time we want to develop and offer the best omega-3 products for an optimal supply. How do we want to achieve this? We - the NORSAN crew - a sailing team of clever minds, tackle the task with a lot of commitment, creativity, and fun. We are there for each other and jump in where the waves are at their highest. We are a strong team with a common goal and keep the course and sails taut even in strong winds. Tasks Your tasks on deck: Independently manage the entire sales process in Hungary, from proactive lead generation and onboarding to long-term partnership development. Build and maintain strong relationships with healthcare professionals (doctors, therapists), retailers, and key business partners to drive brand growth. Act as the face of NORSAN at industry congresses and events, strengthening the brand’s reputation and presence within the Hungarian market. Serve as the primary point of contact for B2B and B2C clients, overseeing order management and ensuring premium service quality. Identify new market opportunities and collaborate with internal teams (Marketing, Logistics) to scale and optimize Hungarian business operations. Requirements You are a native or fluent Hungarian speaker who also has good English skills (German is a plus). Your background includes experience in sales, account management, or customer success. Communication is one of your strengths, and you find it easy to build good relationships. You take a \"hands-on\" approach, meaning you are proactive and work in a very organized way. An interest in health and nutrition is a big advantage and fits our team perfectly. Benefits Vær en viktig del – become an important part of the NORSAN team Responsibility, trust and lots of room to advance. Our goal is to further your personal and professional development. Helse er det viktigste – because health is of importance Big and small health benefits with purpose and love around your well-being because you matter. Suksess feirer vi sammen – we celebrate victories The achievement of a milestone is celebrated. For your private dreams and wishes, you also participate in the attractive NORSAN bonus program. En NORSAN-familie – one NORSAN family With us you will experience unique team events, big and small. Inhale the true NORSAN team spirit and be inspired by the fresh winds blowing in our sails. Bli litt bedre, steg for steg – Improve step by step Besides our mission to contribute to a healthier society we also take a step towards a healthier and more sustainable world by engaging in and investing in social projects. Visit us on LinkedIn or on our website and get to know our great products, the NORSAN team and our corporate culture a little better! The wind is good and there are still so many possibilities that we would like to use and explore together with you! Working hours: 40h/week Location: Berlin-Friedrichshain, right at Ostkreuz Please send your application with your salary expectations and the earliest possible start date. We are looking forward to hearing from you. Felix Kosich from NORSAN Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "manager" ;
