    schema:description "<h2><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Why Verifone</span></h2> <p>For more than 40 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.</p> <p>Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.</p> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW144765670 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW144765670 BCX8\">Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW144765670 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h2><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">About The Role</span></h2> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">We are seeking a visionary and results-oriented <strong>Senior Product Leader </strong>to lead Verifone's product strategy and execution across key business lines. This role will oversee the full product lifecycle, from ideation and market analysis to launch and ongoing optimization. The Senior Director will partner closely with engineering, sales, marketing, and operations to deliver innovative solutions that meet customer needs and drive business growth.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">This is a high-impact leadership role requiring deep product&nbsp;expertise, strategic thinking, and the ability to inspire cross-functional teams in a fast-paced, global environment. The ideal candidate brings broad knowledge across the complete&nbsp;payments&nbsp;solution stack and a proven&nbsp;track record&nbsp;of delivering complex, enterprise-scale initiatives across EMEA markets.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Product Strategy &amp; Leadership</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Develop and execute product strategy aligned with Verifone's vision and business objectives.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Lead portfolio management across multiple product lines, ensuring market relevance and profitability.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Define product roadmaps and prioritize initiatives based on customer needs, market trends, and business goals.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Apply deep knowledge across the complete solution stack — including hardware/payment devices, payment applications, gateways,&nbsp;acquiring&nbsp;processing, and&nbsp;acquiring&nbsp;services — to inform strategic product direction.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Market &amp; Customer Focus</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Conduct market research and competitive analysis to&nbsp;identify&nbsp;opportunities and threats across EMEA and global markets.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Champion the voice of the customer by integrating feedback into product development.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Drive innovation to deliver differentiated solutions in payments and commerce technology.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Understand complex enterprise client needs and drive product and solution adoption by developing tailored solution proposals — including contributions to large, complex RFP submissions across EMEA.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Execution &amp; Delivery</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Oversee the product development lifecycle from concept through launch and post-release optimization.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Collaborate with Engineering and UX teams to deliver high-quality, scalable solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ensure&nbsp;timely&nbsp;delivery of products that meet performance, compliance, and security standards.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Provide technical leadership in the delivery of complex, large-scale projects within the payments industry,&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;accountability for scope, quality, and outcomes.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Cross-functional Collaboration</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Act as the bridge between client, sales, product, engineering, and customer success teams to deliver integrated, scalable, and comprehensive client-centric solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Partner with Sales, Marketing, and Operations to align product strategy with go-to-market execution.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Serve as a trusted advisor to executive leadership on product direction and investment decisions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Support integration activities impacting product portfolios.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Technology &amp; Process Improvement</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Leverage data and analytics to drive product decisions and measure success.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Implement best practices for product management processes, tools, and governance.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Foster a culture of continuous improvement and innovation across product teams.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h2><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Skills and Experience Needed</span></h2> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Bachelor's degree in Business, Engineering, or related field; MBA or advanced degree preferred.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">10+ years of progressive product management experience, including at least 7 years in a senior leadership role.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven success in managing complex product portfolios in technology or fintech industries.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Strong knowledge of payments, commerce platforms, and emerging technologies — with hands-on familiarity across the full solution stack including hardware/payment devices, payment apps, gateways,&nbsp;acquiring&nbsp;processing, and&nbsp;acquiring&nbsp;services.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Demonstrated experience developing tailored solution proposals and contributing to complex RFP submissions for enterprise clients across EMEA.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proven ability to serve as the connective bridge between client-facing, technical, and commercial teams to deliver integrated, enterprise-scale solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Technical leadership experience with&nbsp;a track record&nbsp;of delivering large, complex projects within the payments industry.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Exceptional strategic thinking, communication, and stakeholder management skills.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Experience leading global teams and driving cross-functional collaboration.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Proficiency&nbsp;with product management tools, ERP systems, and analytics platforms.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h2><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Our Commitment</span></h2> <p>Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.</p> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
