    schema:description "Our mission is to enable everyone to build wealth We reinvent how trading and investing work by creating exceptional products people love. Fostering a culture of excellence and high velocity is the key to our success. Today, we serve over 5 million clients, with more than €38 billion in assets under management - a testament to the scale and trust we’ve built in just a few years. What you’ll do Brainstorm ideas with stakeholders and help define early feature concepts Express your design vision via wireframes, high-fidelity designs, and functional prototypes if necessary Present and explain the rationale behind your design decisions on regular peer design review sessions. Collect feedback and quickly iterate. Collaborate closely with engineers to ensure that your designs are accurately implemented according to Trading 212's standards of quality Base your design decisions on data by leveraging Trading 212’s analytics tools and on user feedback by conducting usability tests Evolve and maintain Trading 212’s design library Drive innovation by integrating new tools and workflows into our design process. Be autonomous and have full ownership of your work What you'll need Expert knowledge of user-centric design principles and methodologies Strong visual design skills, including layout, typography, and colour theory Strong diagramming skills - you can reduce complex user flows into clean and easy-to-understand flowcharts. Proven proficiency with Figma, Sketch, or other design tools. Excellent collaborative skills - you can express your ideas verbally and in writing An extensive portfolio that you can share with us What we offer Challenges that will help you grow and realize your potential. Opportunity to make a big impact by building innovative services used by millions worldwide. Work with smart, spirited, and high-performing colleagues with a common goal. Appreciation for your talent and ideas. Generous remuneration package including annual bonuses. Excellent social benefits package, including private health insurance, sports card, and 25 days of paid vacation per year. Delicious treats and a spacious game room.Delicious treats and a spacious game room Bring your ambition to Europe’s fastest-growing mobile broker! Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
