    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h4><strong>Who We Are</strong></h4> <p>WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.</p></div><h3>Senior Project Manager experienced managing technical teams and releases across complex client environments required to join our Team!</h3> <h3>The opportunity</h3> <p>You'll encourage strong relationships with your team and have the ability to talk, at a technical level, with developers and senior technical team members (e.g., technical architects, solution architects etc). You will follow best practices in development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development principals and CI/CD.</p> <h3>What you’ll be doing</h3> <ul> <li>Release and technical reporting regarding project/account technical deliverables, architecture and release pipeline</li> <li>Management of project plans and detailed reporting to ensure efficient tracking of the project</li> <li>RAID log management and escalation for the project</li> <li>Identify technical risks and issues &amp; provide mitigation options to achieve resolution</li> <li>Knowledgeably communicate with stakeholders (internal/external) including chairing technical meetings as required</li> <li>Manage and co-ordinate Internal technical specialists</li> <li>Lead and inspire the team to achieve individual and team objectives</li> <li>Ensure the technical team(s) complete what is expected of them successfully and suggest improvements to processes as required.</li> <li>Define, plan, organise and manage the build of new infrastructure environments</li> <li>Co-ordinate high quality technical solutions, on time, via effective time management</li> <li>Help implement and benchmark the introduction of AI into SDLC.</li> <li>Effectively run complex projects using Agile or Waterfall methodologies.</li> <li>Oversee releases across pre-production and production environments, demonstrating an understanding of dependencies between client systems.</li> <li>Implement technical governance according to the client’s needs</li> <li>Build customer confidence by understanding their needs &amp; delivering first class solutions</li> <li>Set and manage client expectations, addressing issues in a respectful and timely manner and ensuring the organisation maintains a positive image and provides a high-quality service</li> <li>Manage 3rd party product vendors, environments, and client technical resources</li> </ul> <h3>&nbsp;</h3> <h3>What we want from you</h3> <ul> <li>Extensive experience in software development Project Management, supply chain and logistics experience ideally within a retail environment.</li> <li>Understanding of Ecommerce experience is nice to have but this role mainly works on the logistics and supply chain system delivery</li> <li>Ability to read log files, draw conclusions and direct further technical investigation</li> <li>Working with Cloud Technology for Back End and React/Node for Front End</li> <li>Understanding of cloud/on premise infrastructure</li> <li>A basic understanding of Terraform - at a level you can engage with technical teams</li> <li>Familiarity with Google Cloud Platform and Legacy AWS applications</li> <li>Defining, managing and delivering to customer expectations within strict deadlines</li> <li>Full knowledge of the project lifecycle and experience of various project development methodologies (including Agile, Incremental and Waterfall)</li> <li>Comfortable with complex technical environments and legacy systems integration</li> <li>Experience of code management tools such as git, bit bucket, svn</li> <li>Understanding of GitHub or other release pipeline tools</li> <li>Managing 3rd parties</li> <li>Strong time management &amp; organisational skills</li> <li>Excellent negotiation skills and an ability to handle sensitive issues with tact and diplomacy</li> <li>Relevant Project Management qualifications</li> <li>A developer background or programming qualification is advantageous but not essential</li> <li>Proficient with Microsoft Office Packages, especially MS Excel and MS PowerPoint</li> <li>Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English</li> <li>Minimum BA/BS degree with a major in information management, marketing, communications, business or other closely-related areas is an advantage</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <h3>What we can offer you</h3> <p>Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.</p> <p>We lead with&nbsp;<strong>Heart</strong>, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.<br>We empower your&nbsp;<strong>Brains&nbsp;</strong>for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.<br>And we champion&nbsp;<strong>Courage</strong>, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><em><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">How we use AI in the recruitment process:</span></span></strong><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0\"><strong><span class=\"SCXW109799401 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span></strong><br class=\"SCXW109799401 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0\"><span class=\"SCXW109799401 BCX0\">&nbsp;</span><br class=\"SCXW109799401 BCX0\"></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">leverage</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">&nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0\">note-taking</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">&nbsp;Opting out will not&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0\">impact&nbsp; the</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">&nbsp;outcome of the interview process</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0\">\"</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW109799401 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></em></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p></p> <h2><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\">At&nbsp; WPP</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"heading 2\"> Enterprise Solutions</span></span></h2> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:200,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. </span><span data-contrast=\"none\">We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:200,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"none\">To find out more</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, visit </span><a href=\"https://enterprisesolutions.wpp.com/\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">enterprisesolutions.wpp.com</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\"> and follow us on </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpp-enterprise-solutions\"><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-charstyle=\"Hyperlink\">LinkedIn</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:200,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of <a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$\" target=\"_blank\">WPP</a>, the trusted growth partner for the world's leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.</p> <p></p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h4><strong>About WPP</strong></h4> <p class=\"p1\">WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit <a href=\"http://wpp.com/\"><span class=\"s1\">WPP.com</span></a><span class=\"s2\">.</span></p> <p><span class=\"normaltextrun\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.</span></span><span class=\"scxw176048299\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p>When you click \"Submit Application\", this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it's a good idea to read through our <a href=\"https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy\">Recruitment Privacy Policy</a>. California residents should read our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice\">California Recruitment Privacy Notice</a>. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.</p></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
